*
*  Run a survey of Intermolecular Interaction Energies
*  
*
*     Keywords used
*
* SET:        Define a file that contains a list of compounds to be used.
* REF:        Define one or more folders that contain reference data for systems defined by SET.
* SURVEY:     Survey.  
*
set="S12L set for survey.txt" &
ref="../../reference data/Data Intermolecular interactions/S12L" &
survey references="../../Reference data/references.txt" PM6-DH2
*
*
*
end

